1
00:00:03,432 --> 00:00:07,060
And so, the friendly, handsome,
and athletic Junta Hayami…

2
00:00:07,144 --> 00:00:09,479
Uh, thanks for letting me stay.

3
00:00:10,188 --> 00:00:13,817
…has now joined
Anzu's cozy coed living arrangement.

4
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,946
If you want to freshen up,
the bathroom is at the end of the hall.

5
00:00:18,989 --> 00:00:22,200
This is a dream come true scenario.

6
00:00:23,035 --> 00:00:23,952
One more thing.

7
00:00:24,494 --> 00:00:26,955
Since this room only has two beds,

8
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:28,081
would you guys mind--

9
00:00:28,165 --> 00:00:29,374
No way.

10
00:00:29,458 --> 00:00:30,834
Silly me.

11
00:00:31,334 --> 00:00:34,588
It's just a matter of time
before the sparks of love fly!

12
00:00:35,297 --> 00:00:39,176
Well, in that case, we can move Kazuki
into my dad's office instead.

13
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,178
Yeah, works for me.

14
00:00:41,678 --> 00:00:43,972
It'll be great to have a room with a desk.

15
00:00:46,641 --> 00:00:47,517
DAD'S SELECTION

16
00:00:47,601 --> 00:00:48,435
Yay!

17
00:00:48,518 --> 00:00:51,605
Welcome to the love castle!

18
00:00:53,523 --> 00:00:54,941
-Um…
-Huh?

19
00:00:55,859 --> 00:00:59,154
She's so pretty,
I can't even look her in the eyes.

20
00:01:00,155 --> 00:01:02,532
I'm late for practice.
But just let me know

21
00:01:02,616 --> 00:01:04,493
if I can help out with anything, okay?

22
00:01:04,576 --> 00:01:07,079
We've got things handled here.

23
00:01:07,162 --> 00:01:08,205
Right.

24
00:01:12,292 --> 00:01:14,544
Why is all of this happening to me?

25
00:01:15,545 --> 00:01:19,216
-Yeah, it's all too exciting…
-Get back here!

26
00:01:19,299 --> 00:01:21,426
You're gonna pay
for that underwear incident!

27
00:01:21,510 --> 00:01:22,636
Give it up!

28
00:01:26,723 --> 00:01:30,268
I can't believe how nonchalant
Mom is being about this whole thing.

29
00:01:30,894 --> 00:01:33,897
Tried to steal my underwear?
Well, I guess your old mom still got it.

30
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:35,023
MOM'S SLIGHTLY-OFF REACTION

31
00:01:35,107 --> 00:01:38,360
Meanwhile, there's good news.

32
00:01:38,985 --> 00:01:41,947
I got a part-time job
at the convenience store.

33
00:01:42,531 --> 00:01:44,199
Hi, welcome.

34
00:01:45,325 --> 00:01:48,495
Kazuki's always at work,
Junta's busy with baseball,

35
00:01:48,578 --> 00:01:50,580
I bet we'll barely see each other.

36
00:03:21,922 --> 00:03:23,506
#6 A "REINCARNATED-
IN-ANOTHER-WORLD" DATE

37
00:03:23,590 --> 00:03:24,925
Morning.

38
00:03:25,008 --> 00:03:27,469
-Hey.
-Morning.

39
00:03:27,552 --> 00:03:29,888
Anzu, did you get up early
to make us lunch?

40
00:03:29,971 --> 00:03:30,847
Yup.

41
00:03:30,931 --> 00:03:32,682
Our housemother made me.

42
00:03:32,766 --> 00:03:34,434
Who are you calling "housemother"?

43
00:03:34,517 --> 00:03:37,896
It's fine. Now there
are three lunches for us to make,

44
00:03:37,979 --> 00:03:39,606
so I should help out too.

45
00:03:43,526 --> 00:03:46,780
You offered to help.
And lettuce is not a pillow.

46
00:03:46,863 --> 00:03:48,907
Hey, do you mind if I watch?

47
00:03:48,990 --> 00:03:50,867
Watch?
I'll get nervous and mess up.

48
00:03:50,951 --> 00:03:52,577
Yeah, but it won't be his fault.

49
00:03:52,661 --> 00:03:54,162
You have no faith in me at all!

50
00:03:55,121 --> 00:03:57,666
Fine, I'll show you. First, the pasta.

51
00:03:57,749 --> 00:03:59,584
You know you're boiling chopsticks, right?

52
00:04:00,585 --> 00:04:03,588
You're burning Mr. Octopus.

53
00:04:03,672 --> 00:04:05,674
And don't crack
the eggs on your forehead.

54
00:04:05,757 --> 00:04:07,509
You're hopeless.

55
00:04:13,682 --> 00:04:14,599
Hm.

56
00:04:15,684 --> 00:04:18,937
Eh? What's the deal
with your lunch today? It's a mess!

57
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:20,689
I'm usually jealous.

58
00:04:21,690 --> 00:04:23,900
Hmm. I know what's happening here.

59
00:04:23,984 --> 00:04:26,945
You had your old bestie make it for you!

60
00:04:27,028 --> 00:04:30,115
What, I-- No, it's not like that!
My little brother made it!

61
00:04:30,198 --> 00:04:32,492
You're stuttering! We know you're lying!

62
00:04:32,575 --> 00:04:35,120
Come on, this is so not fair.

63
00:04:35,203 --> 00:04:37,872
You get a girl who's cute
and she can cook.

64
00:04:37,956 --> 00:04:39,666
From the look of it, she can't cook.

65
00:04:39,749 --> 00:04:41,960
I told you my little brother made it!

66
00:04:43,044 --> 00:04:45,672
-Did she make him a lunch?
-Yeah.

67
00:04:45,755 --> 00:04:47,966
Wow, do you think they're dating?

68
00:04:55,432 --> 00:04:58,226
Lies! If your little brother
did make it for you,

69
00:04:58,310 --> 00:05:00,353
why are you taking a picture
and smiling like that?

70
00:05:00,437 --> 00:05:04,065
-You sure look guilty.
-Hey, knock it off already!

71
00:05:04,566 --> 00:05:05,483
STEWS
SKEWERED KATSU

72
00:05:05,567 --> 00:05:06,568
Heading home.

73
00:05:07,068 --> 00:05:09,988
Kazuki, please,
work the front of the house?

74
00:05:10,071 --> 00:05:12,741
The customers love you.
What do you say, hmm?

75
00:05:12,824 --> 00:05:15,160
-No thanks, I'll pass.
-That's too bad.

76
00:05:20,457 --> 00:05:22,459
Kazuki, hey, wait up.

77
00:05:23,043 --> 00:05:25,462
Smart turning down the front-of-house gig.

78
00:05:25,545 --> 00:05:28,089
Not like you need any more fans, right?

79
00:05:28,173 --> 00:05:31,092
Hey, wanna hang out? There's a new café.

80
00:05:31,176 --> 00:05:34,387
We can grab a quick bite to eat
and maybe-- Uh?

81
00:05:36,222 --> 00:05:37,182
Goodnight.

82
00:05:38,558 --> 00:05:40,518
Okay, maybe next time.

83
00:05:48,985 --> 00:05:50,612
You're home! What took so long?

84
00:05:50,695 --> 00:05:52,614
We've been waiting for you
to start the show!

85
00:05:52,697 --> 00:05:55,116
Well, hey, whoa, what show?

86
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:58,370
You forgot, huh?
The show Saki recommended. Come on.

87
00:05:59,704 --> 00:06:01,289
Hurry up, go take your bath.

88
00:06:01,915 --> 00:06:04,542
Well, don't take too long.
I'm falling asleep.

89
00:06:04,626 --> 00:06:06,378
You really don't have to wait.

90
00:06:06,461 --> 00:06:09,005
-It's more fun to watch together!
-It's more fun to watch together!

91
00:06:09,089 --> 00:06:10,340
-Uh…
-Jinx.

92
00:06:10,423 --> 00:06:11,591
Mm. Uh…

93
00:06:11,674 --> 00:06:13,301
We said it at the same time.

94
00:06:22,394 --> 00:06:24,229
-I'm off to practice.
-Okay.

95
00:06:24,312 --> 00:06:26,356
Good luck today.

96
00:06:31,069 --> 00:06:32,362
You free later?

97
00:06:32,445 --> 00:06:33,571
Huh?

98
00:06:34,531 --> 00:06:35,865
I'll take that as a yes.

99
00:06:36,449 --> 00:06:37,992
I have to go shopping today.

100
00:06:38,076 --> 00:06:39,869
Would you like to come with me?

101
00:06:39,953 --> 00:06:41,955
Me? Yeah, I guess I can.

102
00:06:42,038 --> 00:06:43,373
Why not ask Makoto?

103
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:46,918
-I did. He's busy.
-Okay.

104
00:06:47,001 --> 00:06:50,839
I guess I could.
But don't you normally shop alone?

105
00:06:50,922 --> 00:06:53,383
It's nice to have a shield
from other girls.

106
00:06:53,466 --> 00:06:56,302
Oh well, then I salute your hotness.

107
00:06:57,429 --> 00:06:59,764
Seriously, though,
I buy all my clothes online,

108
00:06:59,848 --> 00:07:01,766
so I don't really know
where to go around here.

109
00:07:01,850 --> 00:07:03,768
It's all right,
I know where to go.

110
00:07:03,852 --> 00:07:06,980
Can't you just shop online?
It's way easier.

111
00:07:08,773 --> 00:07:10,108
I prefer in person.

112
00:07:11,276 --> 00:07:12,444
Hmm.

113
00:07:14,404 --> 00:07:16,656
Okay, let me go change.
Be right back.

114
00:07:19,325 --> 00:07:21,244
-Let's go!
-Already?

115
00:07:21,327 --> 00:07:23,455
LAME

116
00:07:25,623 --> 00:07:27,584
You didn't even change your shirt.

117
00:07:28,710 --> 00:07:31,254
Why change? This is a clean shirt.

118
00:07:31,337 --> 00:07:33,173
We're not going grocery shopping.

119
00:07:33,256 --> 00:07:35,633
The jeans are one thing, but that shirt…

120
00:07:35,717 --> 00:07:36,926
How's this one?

121
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,761
Do you really not see it?

122
00:07:38,845 --> 00:07:40,138
How about this?

123
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,515
All of your shirts
have cats on them?

124
00:07:43,057 --> 00:07:44,225
Let me decide.

125
00:07:44,309 --> 00:07:46,728
No, wait!

126
00:07:46,811 --> 00:07:49,814
Ah! I'm drying my underwear!

127
00:07:50,815 --> 00:07:53,359
Even your underwear looks
like something a child would wear.

128
00:07:53,443 --> 00:07:56,154
How dare you? These are adorable!

129
00:07:56,237 --> 00:07:59,199
Please get those out of my face.
This is getting weird.

130
00:08:00,450 --> 00:08:01,576
So, look.

131
00:08:01,659 --> 00:08:04,621
I assumed
that you have a variety of clothing…

132
00:08:08,374 --> 00:08:09,209
MEOW

133
00:08:09,292 --> 00:08:11,085
…but this is all you've got!

134
00:08:11,169 --> 00:08:13,963
What? And just
what is so wrong with these?

135
00:08:14,047 --> 00:08:16,007
Do you have cash?

136
00:08:16,591 --> 00:08:19,177
Well, I've got
some holiday money left over.

137
00:08:19,260 --> 00:08:20,595
Planning on using it?

138
00:08:21,179 --> 00:08:23,848
No definitive plans, but,

139
00:08:24,891 --> 00:08:26,935
I was gonna buy games with it.

140
00:08:28,186 --> 00:08:30,021
Let's buy you new clothes.

141
00:08:31,189 --> 00:08:32,273
Huh?

142
00:08:35,610 --> 00:08:37,529
It's fine to dress comfy at home,

143
00:08:37,612 --> 00:08:39,405
but get normal outfits to wear in public.

144
00:08:39,489 --> 00:08:40,823
Cats are normal!

145
00:08:41,324 --> 00:08:43,618
Wait, I just realized,

146
00:08:43,701 --> 00:08:46,621
you're gonna have to go out
shopping in these.

147
00:08:47,872 --> 00:08:49,999
Sorry to interrupt,
couldn't help overhearing

148
00:08:50,083 --> 00:08:51,709
and I think I can help out!

149
00:08:51,793 --> 00:08:53,628
You're still alive?

150
00:08:53,711 --> 00:08:55,046
-Huh?
-Leave it to me.

151
00:08:55,129 --> 00:08:57,757
I'll go help Anzu pick out
something super cute!

152
00:08:58,299 --> 00:09:00,885
Just hang tight
and we'll be down in a jiff.

153
00:09:03,888 --> 00:09:05,515
Now that my wand is all clean again,

154
00:09:05,598 --> 00:09:07,934
I can finally get back to using my magic.

155
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:12,021
Wait, the underwear thief
was totally your doing, wasn't it?

156
00:09:12,105 --> 00:09:15,525
Yup! Had to cash in a favor
at headquarters for that one.

157
00:09:15,608 --> 00:09:17,694
Headquarters just made my list.

158
00:09:18,319 --> 00:09:21,322
Now, now, give us a smile,
you've got a big date.

159
00:09:21,406 --> 00:09:22,949
So, let's go get you dressed.

160
00:09:23,032 --> 00:09:24,909
We're going shopping, it's not a date.

161
00:09:24,993 --> 00:09:27,412
And I'm not going
if you're gonna be weird.

162
00:09:27,495 --> 00:09:30,999
Hey, stop being so mean
or I'm gonna throw everything away.

163
00:09:31,499 --> 00:09:32,667
Huh?

164
00:09:34,002 --> 00:09:35,378
All of this.

165
00:09:35,962 --> 00:09:37,589
Each and every outfit.

166
00:09:43,803 --> 00:09:45,346
-We are ready!
-Huh?

167
00:09:45,430 --> 00:09:47,807
The wait is over.

168
00:09:48,308 --> 00:09:50,310
Here she is.

169
00:09:50,393 --> 00:09:51,519
Ooh.

170
00:09:52,895 --> 00:09:55,523
Did I really have
to put on all this makeup?

171
00:09:56,232 --> 00:09:58,026
This is so embarrassing.

172
00:10:00,194 --> 00:10:01,571
Uh…

173
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:08,453
Sorry… to keep you waiting.

174
00:10:09,871 --> 00:10:10,788
It's fine.

175
00:10:11,289 --> 00:10:14,709
Is it really hot in here,
or am I nervous?

176
00:10:14,792 --> 00:10:16,127
This is really exciting.

177
00:10:17,003 --> 00:10:18,588
-Let's go.
-Right.

178
00:10:19,172 --> 00:10:22,300
All dressed up like that. You look nice.

179
00:10:28,806 --> 00:10:29,974
What's with your face?

180
00:10:30,058 --> 00:10:32,518
I feel like I look weird in this.

181
00:10:32,602 --> 00:10:34,103
Your face is weird.

182
00:10:34,979 --> 00:10:36,898
Oh, man.
Here I am, all dressed up.

183
00:10:36,981 --> 00:10:39,108
-Hairdo and makeup…
-Anzu!

184
00:10:39,192 --> 00:10:41,402
New outfit counts as an expense.

185
00:10:41,986 --> 00:10:44,906
On my way
to go shopping with a hot guy.

186
00:10:45,490 --> 00:10:49,869
I am absolutely 100 percent
going on a date right now.

187
00:11:01,005 --> 00:11:04,509
What am I
doing here? I usually just go online

188
00:11:04,592 --> 00:11:06,969
and get all the cute cat clothes
I can find.

189
00:11:07,053 --> 00:11:10,515
Everyone here is so stylish.
It's like another world.

190
00:11:10,598 --> 00:11:11,808
That face again?

191
00:11:11,891 --> 00:11:14,352
-This is how my face looks.
-It's ugly.

192
00:11:15,103 --> 00:11:16,688
Okay, that hurts.

193
00:11:16,771 --> 00:11:20,274
This place is packed.
Let's do this quickly.

194
00:11:21,734 --> 00:11:24,654
Kazuki, do you like hats?
I mean, 'cause you were wearing one

195
00:11:24,737 --> 00:11:26,906
when we first met
at the convenience store too.

196
00:11:27,615 --> 00:11:30,952
No, not really.
But it helps to hide my face.

197
00:11:31,494 --> 00:11:33,037
Yeah, but…

198
00:11:33,121 --> 00:11:34,580
It doesn't seem to be working.

199
00:11:36,416 --> 00:11:37,709
So, why not wear a mask?

200
00:11:38,209 --> 00:11:39,168
I tried.

201
00:11:39,252 --> 00:11:42,130
Someone followed me home
thinking I was a celebrity.

202
00:11:42,213 --> 00:11:45,633
Well, I guess there's no hiding it
when you're that good-looking.

203
00:11:46,592 --> 00:11:49,011
Jeez,
he really hates being popular.

204
00:11:50,221 --> 00:11:54,183
I wonder if that's why he moved away,
to go to a different high school?

205
00:11:58,646 --> 00:12:00,481
-Let the games begin!
-Huh?

206
00:12:00,565 --> 00:12:02,108
Oh.

207
00:12:02,859 --> 00:12:03,860
Uh…

208
00:12:08,364 --> 00:12:10,283
Whoa! Kitty pajamas!

209
00:12:10,366 --> 00:12:13,745
It's cute! I want it!

210
00:12:23,546 --> 00:12:24,797
I can't believe it.

211
00:12:24,881 --> 00:12:28,593
I bought something with no cat on it?
No cat.

212
00:12:28,676 --> 00:12:31,053
-Is that a big deal?
-Huh?

213
00:12:31,637 --> 00:12:33,014
That's your first expense.

214
00:12:33,514 --> 00:12:34,974
This is not good.

215
00:12:35,057 --> 00:12:38,144
I let them dress me up
and I'm paying for a cute outfit

216
00:12:38,227 --> 00:12:40,521
that Kazuki chose for me.

217
00:12:40,605 --> 00:12:41,522
Yay!

218
00:12:41,606 --> 00:12:44,025
It's like I'm falling
into their trap!

219
00:12:44,108 --> 00:12:47,487
I'll show them. I'll only wear it
for special occasions!

220
00:12:48,946 --> 00:12:52,074
I could never let Junta
see me in this.

221
00:12:52,658 --> 00:12:55,036
Hungry? Do you wanna grab a bite to eat?

222
00:12:55,536 --> 00:12:57,288
Sure, but…

223
00:12:57,371 --> 00:12:59,123
I have to go pee before that.

224
00:12:59,207 --> 00:13:00,666
Don't say "go pee."

225
00:13:01,250 --> 00:13:03,711
The bathroom was over there.
Be right back, okay?

226
00:13:03,795 --> 00:13:05,880
Sure, I'll find a place to eat.

227
00:13:05,963 --> 00:13:06,798
Uh.

228
00:13:07,381 --> 00:13:08,549
Oh, your bags.

229
00:13:16,224 --> 00:13:17,099
Hmm.

230
00:13:19,602 --> 00:13:21,604
Hey, look at him!

231
00:13:22,271 --> 00:13:24,524
Oh my, I wonder
if he's meeting up with someone.

232
00:13:24,607 --> 00:13:28,027
-Such a hottie.
-He's so handsome. Oh, my gosh.

233
00:13:36,536 --> 00:13:37,995
What's taking so long?

234
00:13:41,582 --> 00:13:42,875
Wanna talk to him?

235
00:13:42,959 --> 00:13:44,460
Think he's got a girlfriend?

236
00:13:44,544 --> 00:13:46,504
Only one way to find out.

237
00:13:50,424 --> 00:13:52,927
Oh, why do I have to wait
out in the open like this?

238
00:13:56,597 --> 00:13:59,392
Come on, hurry up and get back.

239
00:14:00,017 --> 00:14:03,020
Please, just leave me alone.

240
00:14:09,193 --> 00:14:10,820
Tsukasa…

241
00:14:12,989 --> 00:14:14,198
Don't look at me.

242
00:14:16,325 --> 00:14:18,494
Tsukasa…

243
00:14:20,413 --> 00:14:21,497
Go away.

244
00:14:22,290 --> 00:14:23,457
Go away!

245
00:14:24,625 --> 00:14:25,668
Kazuki!

246
00:14:29,005 --> 00:14:29,964
Huh.

247
00:14:33,509 --> 00:14:35,428
Sorry you had to wait,

248
00:14:35,511 --> 00:14:37,346
but I found the best store ever.

249
00:14:37,972 --> 00:14:38,806
Oh.

250
00:14:38,890 --> 00:14:40,224
Quick, come look!

251
00:14:40,308 --> 00:14:41,601
Huh?

252
00:14:55,406 --> 00:14:58,576
How did I live my life before this?

253
00:15:00,244 --> 00:15:01,746
Thanks for inviting me along.

254
00:15:03,497 --> 00:15:04,332
Uh…

255
00:15:12,506 --> 00:15:13,507
It's been fun.

256
00:15:16,427 --> 00:15:18,262
Huh?

257
00:15:18,346 --> 00:15:20,473
It looks just like MomohikI!

258
00:15:21,182 --> 00:15:24,518
I want it, uh, but I spent all my money.

259
00:15:25,227 --> 00:15:26,562
I'll come back on payday.

260
00:15:27,063 --> 00:15:29,315
I can buy it for you.

261
00:15:29,899 --> 00:15:31,817
As a thanks for coming with me.

262
00:15:31,901 --> 00:15:34,320
Uh… Uh…

263
00:15:34,403 --> 00:15:35,321
MY GOD

264
00:15:35,404 --> 00:15:37,490
-Thank you so much!
-Thank you so much!

265
00:15:40,576 --> 00:15:42,954
It's so cute!

266
00:15:43,037 --> 00:15:46,874
I love it so much.
I promise to take great care of it.

267
00:15:46,958 --> 00:15:47,959
Okay.

268
00:15:49,877 --> 00:15:51,963
Damn, it's later than I thought it was.

269
00:15:52,046 --> 00:15:53,965
Huh?

270
00:15:54,757 --> 00:15:55,758
Anzu?

271
00:15:58,719 --> 00:16:01,514
Wow, you change your look.

272
00:16:01,597 --> 00:16:02,932
It's all Riri.

273
00:16:04,308 --> 00:16:06,894
It must be new. And there are no cats.

274
00:16:07,937 --> 00:16:09,522
She looks so cute.

275
00:16:09,605 --> 00:16:11,899
How long have you been wearing cats
on all your clothes?

276
00:16:11,983 --> 00:16:16,445
-Uh, did you two go somewhere?
-Yeah, picked up some new clothes.

277
00:16:16,529 --> 00:16:18,364
No!

278
00:16:18,447 --> 00:16:19,532
Not fair, not fair…

279
00:16:19,615 --> 00:16:22,368
-Stop looking at me like that.
-Not fair, not fair, not fair, not fair…

280
00:16:22,451 --> 00:16:24,120
That was a long practice.

281
00:16:24,203 --> 00:16:26,622
Bet you're starving.
Does teriyaki sound good?

282
00:16:26,706 --> 00:16:28,499
Heck, yeah! Sounds great.

283
00:16:28,582 --> 00:16:31,043
I'll start making dinner
as soon as we get home.

284
00:16:31,127 --> 00:16:32,128
Can't wait.

285
00:16:34,797 --> 00:16:37,925
I was worried
Riri would spend the whole day meddling,

286
00:16:38,009 --> 00:16:40,720
but it actually turned out
to be pretty peaceful.

287
00:16:41,345 --> 00:16:43,889
Hey, wanna watch our show while we eat?

288
00:16:44,515 --> 00:16:45,349
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

289
00:16:45,433 --> 00:16:46,600
-Huh?
-Um…

290
00:16:48,436 --> 00:16:52,356
I can't wait to see what happened
after the zombies caught them.

291
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:54,358
It's gonna be so good!

292
00:17:08,831 --> 00:17:11,333
That thing! It's back!

293
00:17:11,417 --> 00:17:12,960
IT'S SUPER GROSS,
WE DISGUISED IT AS A CAKE

294
00:17:13,044 --> 00:17:16,213
Kazuki, kill it! Kill it now!

295
00:17:16,297 --> 00:17:17,506
Not again.

296
00:17:17,590 --> 00:17:20,509
IT'S SUPER GROSS,
WE DISGUISED IT AS A CAKE

297
00:17:20,593 --> 00:17:23,012
Hey, Junta, help me lift the couch.

298
00:17:23,596 --> 00:17:25,681
What?

299
00:17:30,978 --> 00:17:33,064
Fine, I'll just get it myself!

300
00:17:42,490 --> 00:17:44,825
Man, I'm glad you're here.

301
00:17:45,993 --> 00:17:49,830
Kazuki, I know moving in so quick
was kinda nuts,

302
00:17:49,914 --> 00:17:52,708
but you've been a lifesaver for me.

303
00:17:56,003 --> 00:17:58,589
Unlike me,
I'm sorry I'm so useless.

304
00:17:58,672 --> 00:18:02,009
Not true, Junta,
you caught that awful panty thief!

305
00:18:02,093 --> 00:18:04,970
I can't even protect you
from a bug.

306
00:18:05,054 --> 00:18:07,515
Hey, no,
those things are the worst.

307
00:18:08,265 --> 00:18:10,851
There. See?

308
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:15,106
Maybe I'm the one who's being saved.

309
00:18:25,449 --> 00:18:28,035
So far, the sleeping arrangements
have been kinda nice.

310
00:18:28,119 --> 00:18:30,037
Might just work out after all.

311
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:39,547
Oh no, I wouldn't get
so comfortable just yet.

312
00:18:39,630 --> 00:18:42,758
I still have one more player for our game.

313
00:18:54,186 --> 00:18:55,312
Wake up!

314
00:18:59,692 --> 00:19:01,819
Kazuki? Why are you in my room?

315
00:19:01,902 --> 00:19:04,071
Well, I tried shouting from downstairs,

316
00:19:04,155 --> 00:19:05,489
but you were out cold.

317
00:19:05,573 --> 00:19:07,158
But my alarm…

318
00:19:07,241 --> 00:19:08,409
Oh crap!

319
00:19:08,492 --> 00:19:10,953
Just go! Go on without me!

320
00:19:11,036 --> 00:19:12,997
Yeah, I wasn't planning on waiting.

321
00:19:14,206 --> 00:19:16,167
I've never overslept for school!

322
00:19:18,294 --> 00:19:22,882
How did this happen? I'm so screwed!

323
00:19:26,677 --> 00:19:29,096
Oh no, I'm gonna be late!

324
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:32,933
Wait. What did I just say?

325
00:19:33,017 --> 00:19:34,602
That phrase…

326
00:19:34,685 --> 00:19:37,688
It sounded so familiar.

327
00:19:38,230 --> 00:19:40,608
I'm gonna be late!

328
00:19:43,611 --> 00:19:46,906
This is way too similar
to one of those dating sim scenarios.

329
00:19:48,199 --> 00:19:51,577
There's no chance
a third guy shows up, right?

330
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:55,080
I'm coming up on the corner.
You don't think…

331
00:19:55,664 --> 00:19:56,707
Nah, there's no way.

332
00:19:56,790 --> 00:20:00,127
I'm not even running with toast
in my mouth, so--

333
00:20:04,715 --> 00:20:09,720
Uh, it was just a car,
not another cute boy. I'm safe.

334
00:20:09,803 --> 00:20:12,014
Wait! That car just hit me!

335
00:20:14,141 --> 00:20:16,977
I'm terribly sorry, miss.
Are you hurt?

336
00:20:23,025 --> 00:20:24,109
Uh…

337
00:20:25,027 --> 00:20:26,946
I'm fine. Not even a scratch.

338
00:20:27,863 --> 00:20:31,533
She's the one who went running
out into the street right in front of us.

339
00:20:31,617 --> 00:20:35,120
There's absolutely
no need for us to apologize to her.

340
00:20:39,124 --> 00:20:41,752
You're the one
with the toast in your mouth?

341
00:20:50,052 --> 00:20:51,720
A fanfare, please!

342
00:20:51,804 --> 00:20:54,139
And a big congratulations!

343
00:20:54,223 --> 00:20:56,183
Did you fall for my little trick?

344
00:20:56,267 --> 00:20:59,103
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

345
00:20:59,186 --> 00:21:02,856
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

346
00:21:02,940 --> 00:21:05,609
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

347
00:21:05,693 --> 00:21:08,237
Don't just let things be! Come on!

348
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:10,739
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

349
00:21:10,823 --> 00:21:12,658
So I can make sure I get paid.

